Package: sqpost
Type: Package
Title: Square-Root Posterior Density Approximation via Gaussian Basis
Version: 1.0.0
Date: 2026-07-28
Author: Wenje Ma
Maintainer: Wenje Ma <wenjema@example.com>
Description: Implements the basis-expansion method from Joseph (2013)
    for approximating an unnormalized posterior density. Fits a
    square-root Gaussian process approximation to design points
    (e.g., generated by minimum energy design), estimates length
    scales via leave-one-out cross-validation, and computes marginal
    posterior densities using closed-form integrals. Designed to
    work with the 'mined' package for Bayesian computation with
    expensive log-posterior evaluations.
License: GPL-3
Imports:
    stats
Encoding: UTF-8
LazyData: false
NeedsCompilation: no
